        "A photo-realistic shoot from a profile camera angle about a young asian woman standing in a flooded industrial environment, wearing a red dress. the image also shows red flowers and tangled wires in the background. on the middle of the image, a 20-year-old woman, who appears to be in her mid-twenties, with long black hair, is standing with her back to the camera, looking to the side with a serene expression. she is wearing a sleeveless red dress and has a silver choker around her neck. her hair is styled in long hair and falls down her back. she has a slender physique and is wearing earrings. her body is partially submerged in the water, with water droplets visible on her skin. the background features a high-tech laboratory with various machinery and wires, and the lighting is bright and natural."
